{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "6b38fd61118fd2cc75a98ba0659b400ba81580fbab12c1646e15703a7a49fbc4", "ja": "センパイVS年上！", "zh": "前辈VS年长者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4f7c9c0ec158d128bcc7f883bfe2eee061d44fcd71e730edd0a66f7109b5a268", "ja": "レッスン初日にも関わらず、響の歌と\nダンスはかなりのレベル。スタミナのある\n奈緒以外、誰も響についていけない。奈緒は\nみんなを心配してペースダウンを提案するが\n響に却下されてしまう。", "zh": "才第一天训练，响就拿出了相当高的\n歌唱及舞蹈水准。除了精力充沛的奈绪以外，\n没有人能跟得上响的步调。\n奈绪担心其他人，因此提议放慢训练节奏，\n却被响否决了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce67c39f568d82bdcd7bb346398b6c924ef4fc1cbaad1fc05547c3adaf739a07", "ja": "（今日から、5人での合同レッスンだ。\n全員がそろうのは、ミーティング以来だけど……）", "zh": "（五人的共同训练课程从今天开始。\n最近一次全员到齐，已经是之前开会时的事了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "d1a959b02a1c092960b2b7b3622a9b31fd4660b8188a0a65a82e64a93e13c08c", "ja": "えっと……こんな感じかな！", "zh": "差不多……就是这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "5c285eb9d417b5cdc67faddbc4ecfdb717106ad474981426b8b5378525819c2c", "ja": "はぁ～。今のは、なかなかハードやったな！\nま、私はスタミナあるほうやから大丈夫やけど。", "zh": "呼～刚刚的动作有够累人耶！\n我是因为体力不错，所以还做得来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bc5146ef79674808bd6503354258e3a6f62a7fb11ca1742f100e6e2171b49216", "ja": "（うん、響はさすがだな。\n元からダンスが得意な事もあって、安定してる）", "zh": "（嗯，真不愧是响。\n她原本就擅长跳舞，表现得也很稳定。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d0e20e1ede8597135bea2300a269eff1bf708ec5c6ae03b6d8dfecdf4af2aea2", "ja": "（奈緒も自分で言うとおり、スタミナがある方だから\n体力的には問題なさそうだ。あとは……）", "zh": "（奈绪也跟她自己说的一样精力充沛，\n体力上感觉没什么问题。剩下的就是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "0a06742b3578b4c4455d08a699d1fc3678cfa48b38c8aaf911cb4ff0788fda0b", "ja": "あれっ？　えっと～……\nここの振り付けって、どんな感じだったっけ？", "zh": "咦？呃……\n我忘了这里的舞步是什么耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "68d47ae71b3a425f7e4dfd784af20eddb10b4e8147f324cbf1505929cbabaf30", "ja": "うう、みんなのダンスについていけない……。\n私も、もっとスタミナつけないとかなぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜，我跟不上大家的舞步……\n我是不是也该再加强体能呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "c4503916973ef376723c9f18000cb710916d7e94e571c39125b1964aca7d0953", "ja": "杏奈も……。\n合わせるのって、難しい……ね……。", "zh": "杏奈也……\n要配合大家的动作……好难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "5065a940274c24d6f1410ae1746729c9356d94a051cc3f37832df3f73c3fe8f5", "ja": "みんな、今のところわかった？\nそれじゃ、次はペース上げていくぞ！", "zh": "各位，到这里都懂了吗？\n那接下来要加快速度了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "75004bfa4c3e0a4b4ea871afc6692fb5f338aee925ce2f91cc7a1e3eafb5931b", "ja": "えっ！？　せやけど、まだみんなが……\n響、ホンマにペース上げるん？", "zh": "咦！？可是大家都还没……\n响，你真的要加快速度吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "47b1d53d3a6997785b60ac553ce1787102f2d4f1b10cecb736a8fbe4f48ef9ce", "ja": "うん！　自分についてきて！", "zh": "嗯！大家跟上本人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b3eb3114ba2872b6cd561f8728168a1b3098a24b350de826a9f7996ff7dd6aa", "ja": "うへー……。", "zh": "呜呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "6e2539959f41a5c409d146a408992a30194b15f442ef35db32e776c9883dc900", "ja": "レッスン……、疲れた……。", "zh": "训练……好累……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8de66bfb4a3a67fcecf854cc93c2334d309ba3bd206f52e421bcfdb0652de683", "ja": "そうね……。しっかりクールダウンして、\n疲れを明日に残さないようにしましょう。", "zh": "对啊……大家要做好收操，\n这样明天才不会肌肉酸痛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ffd681828abec8218773fc5391a94398e0e0cddd79b2aa60f52765ec2572390", "ja": "響さん、やっぱりすごいな～。\n歌もダンスも、バッチリ決まってました♪", "zh": "响果然很厉害呢～\n唱歌跟跳舞都表现得相当到位♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "f0842a84d7c41c74fceaf7fbee23aff15e468d92006f1732ecc60223a84cf697", "ja": "ふふんっ、そうでしょ！\n自分、カンペキだからね！", "zh": "哼哼，对吧！\n毕竟本人很完美啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "d47b6832a56eaaccef5d6ed8429851470206389289ee942415f18fe9af9663e7", "ja": "せやけど響、もうちょい手加減してくれへん？\n今のペースやと、みんな全然ついていかれへんわ。", "zh": "不过吼，响，你能不能把进度放慢一点呀？\n照现在这种速度，大家完全跟不上啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "00644727ed6eaedf9d4d4a39ede213838356484233aa6b8eee9a5cf29d359f4f", "ja": "手加減なんてしないぞ、奈緒！　トップアイドルを\n目指すんなら、みんなもこれくらいできなくちゃ！", "zh": "本人是不会放水的喔，奈绪！既然我们的目标是\n顶尖偶像，大家就得达到这种程度才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "bfc09d001f202eb7a6adcbc6bca455e9d5ea08919f506aa3170552e56cba6edc", "ja": "響の言うこともわかるけど……、今日まだ初日やろ？\nいろいろ覚えてへんことも多いし。", "zh": "我也懂你的意思啦……但今天才第一天不是吗？\n大家有很多东西都还没记起来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "abaa8775cfd6d9b19fbe8ba3baae6ed7658158e7b1443cff8dd664b07b0a7405", "ja": "私ら、まだ響と同じようにはできひんし。\nここは、後輩に優しくしてくれてもええんちゃうかな？", "zh": "也还没有办法表现得跟响一样咩。\n对我们这些后辈宽容一点也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "003831bc2d9e431b62b16cbde55f1f1d915583731a3930934e4d8e4107320c18", "ja": "むっ……。そんなこと言うなら、ちょっとだけど\nセンパイの自分についてきてくれてもいいでしょ！", "zh": "唔……你要这么说的话，\n本人的资历也只深一点点，大家也该跟上本人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "b87b3a655c142492408ab8dce17839c5ed047e66936a354c9579b0eba5521950", "ja": "それを言うたら、ちょっとやけど\n年上の私の言うこと聞いてくれてもええやん！", "zh": "要这么说的话，我的年纪还比你大一点吼，\n应该可以听听我的意见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "7eea6ef1ab86188ae65d08a4bfb52fe6ae9f4393485741133435f41e59d27c91", "ja": "むー！", "zh": "哼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "6bee9be7e3debf263a1684c9db0cf712305076b4e9abe5454e6ce326937d3c56", "ja": "むむー！", "zh": "哼哼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "1736d6d4156c37859411f1650ff2fa129db2542c63eeb4fc6dc65be902120e52", "ja": "えと……。響さん……、奈緒さん……。", "zh": "呃……响……奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c523383a212f51b02ec43ce0d92d5592ad158b2e5cebb8b8fbe5aed8b0090795", "ja": "まあまあ。\nふたりとも、落ち着いて……ね？", "zh": "好了好了。\n你们两个都冷静点……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "bb4815386ca4de1124f6d6878b5876f241b5c27ee2755d371bf9a779c67ba9be", "ja": "そうだな。初回のレッスンは順調だったし、\n今日のところはこれで解散しようか。", "zh": "说的也是，第一次训练也很顺利，\n今天就到这里结束吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "da3380768bc817422e24aefe39ccbed993b3fe3e2e04428a11b85c944d17f061", "ja": "響は、そろそろ帰らなきゃいけない時間だろ？", "zh": "响，都这个时间了，你也差不多该回家了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "7b8513c912283c0410cbf596d1ea3a1a82c7b8ba3c7501db5d080ce4f2df903d", "ja": "え？　……あーっ、もうこんな時間！？\nいぬ美達のご飯の時間に、間に合わなくなっちゃう！", "zh": "咦……啊──怎么已经这么晚了！？\n要赶不上汪美牠们的吃饭时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "8447cb7b7ec791b26f1cfb697f837246d1bbc5065543838f17a522b115499fb7", "ja": "自分、急いで帰らなくっちゃ！\nじゃあね、みんな！", "zh": "本人得赶快回去才行！\n大家拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b2a9bf658ec69bfd17f8c066e99936cf49af3eace6fafb86d5b1e86eabca47d6", "ja": "気をつけてね、響ちゃん！\n……それじゃ、私たちも帰りましょうか。", "zh": "路上小心喔，响！\n……那我们也回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "35789744e0a3c08bf876c0a4941ac97edf349bb8a60935ee223d2340e9c64231", "ja": "はーいっ！\n{$P$}さんも、一緒に帰りましょう！", "zh": "好──！\n{$P$}先生也一起回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "284ec783cbf7addfba0883a057f235b93643d3b585d3e734c2344b10e3837d89", "ja": "にしても、響はスパルタすぎるわー。\nちょっとぐらい手加減してくれてもええのに……。", "zh": "话说回来，响的训练也太斯巴达了吼──\n对我们标准松一点又有什么关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "ebe1fa98f75bbedab8da1343346d66493f22ae1a17d89c0690bc73c6013198d9", "ja": "全員が響に合わせられるならいいんやけど、\nそれが難しいから言うてんのに……。", "zh": "如果大家都跟得上她那当然很好，\n但就是因为有困难，我才开口的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fd1c0d83f983317fc6a8adc50616357caad96a08d8cd3db9d3e0e26028e11ee8", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん……私たち、みんなのことを\n心配してくれてるのね。", "zh": "奈绪……\n你是在担心我们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "fa8c34335f49be04fb3ab7f254250a82462a13e3f228a81c02695b7ceb08bacd", "ja": "え！？　いや、そんな深刻には考えてへんけど……\nせっかく5人で歌うんやし、楽しくやりたいやん？", "zh": "咦！？没啦，我没想那么深……只是想说难得我们五个人\n一起唱歌，当然是开心一点比较好咩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ef9c35bc2fba6ce10c5ad1669cb4212697a8f83db522f92491fcb22c942b5f8", "ja": "あーっ、奈緒ちゃん、照れてる♪", "zh": "啊～奈绪害羞了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "17865840758878cb3ddc702f7828062328cd1d6c1ccd40dc1481a40a12c35348", "ja": "やめーや未来！　いうとくけど、今日の未来のダンス、\n盆踊りみたいになっとったで？　人のこと言えんけど！", "zh": "别这样啦，未来！我先跟你说，今天你的舞跳得\n就跟盂兰盆舞一样嘿，没有资格说别人啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed14a7c31961d237f8f9ec7eddbe208bd3b31b57750234f784928a95c50e5b06", "ja": "えへへ、そうでした……。\nはいっ、春日未来、これからもがんばりまーす♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我都忘了……\n嗯，春日未来，今后也会继续加油──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b0e96e9976d78251d5bbf2ec7b124ddc2d0e2e08d39ef188d261db04845efe40", "ja": "うんうん、いいお返事だね♪\nがんばろうね、未来ちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，回答得很好♪\n一起加油吧，未来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "5035cf5ae2bae4fc387924eed1a96f3f41dd4a7ddbf7ce64c62dbd0b744141c9", "ja": "でへへ、風花さんに頭なでてもらっちゃった♪\n杏奈もなでてもらえば？　気持ちいいよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，风花姊摸我的头了♪\n杏奈要不要也让风花姊摸一下？很舒服喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "d0a7ed1b2cb38f393683e5da9c667988ae3259c831cbbc81feed9c55e8746bf1", "ja": "えっ……でも……。", "zh": "咦……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e45e363cf02849eca9d65604806915da174a7d5946f2e09d83eae5f68c0d4972", "ja": "ふふっ。\n杏奈ちゃん、遠慮なんかしなくていいんだよ♪", "zh": "呵呵。\n杏奈，你不用客气喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "773e81365221021e46f3e519849e056a696524977f168595ad1e146f3460028b", "ja": "ほな、ついでに私もなでてもらおーっと。", "zh": "好，那风花姊也摸摸我的头吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "354e25acc8ddcfbcbec62db0926b5b3d474529a7c6028a7d042f13c380c1ae20", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんは\nダメですからね？　ふふん♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生\n可不行喔？哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9a375e90c5d13715fe79ddc3a24c917f9d1ce1e90965110def9bcb9b6db49cad", "ja": "いや、何も頼んでないだろ？", "zh": "欸，我根本没有要求吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80caebb18bfed7921be02aa328729d8324b5e22e383bf6e2e73ec2f5bee56bb4", "ja": "えっ。イヤなんですか？", "zh": "咦？你不喜欢被我摸头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "8087a4617ea87fa702973baa9f1582903bb42ddd398e005ee5d6ceda8b41f4fe", "ja": "いや、別にイヤとかじゃなくて……", "zh": "呃，也没有不喜欢就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "1f5275e3474842a1e04f917520a2100c719f3ee93f6d53938d4ab3e9f34398c5", "ja": "あ～。{$P$}さん、\n風花さんをいじめないでくださいね！", "zh": "啊～{$P$}先生，\n请不要欺负风花姊喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1049_024ann", "source_sha256": "8bbca8f80acf8558bc35f81624d1192f35f07f5c78cb644f23fd8a9a22952ccc", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n意地悪、なの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你很……坏心眼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "4082d0875c1758f2eb66a091922147af7a8f7e5700ed7f663e7bc2a1d4cacef3", "ja": "だから、そういうことでもなくて……\nこら奈緒、何を笑ってるんだ！？", "zh": "所以我说不是那个意思……\n喂，奈绪，你在笑什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "320c3c5849a4f9f4048094b24efcf347bb4f3601e4bd70c740320520c7ff6d5b", "ja": "（それから駅に着くまで、皆にいじられ続けた。\nまあ、みんなが楽しそうで何よりだった……かな？）", "zh": "（接下来一直到抵达车站之前，大家都不停开我玩笑。\n算了，她们高兴……就好吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
